@startuml
title OGC API MCP Reference System - System Architecture

skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor "Human User" as User

package "Terra Console (ui/)" {
  component "React SPA\n(chat, maps, approval cards)" as React
  component "Node/Express Gateway\nindex.mjs, agent.mjs" as Gateway
  component "Gemini\n(OpenAI-compatible API)" as Gemini
}

component "MCP Client (stdio / streamable-http)" as Client
component "FastMCP Server\napp.py" as App
component "Proxy Runtime\nruntime.py" as Runtime
database "Plan Store\nmemory or Redis" as PlanStore
database "Proxy Memory Store\nmemory or Redis" as MemoryStore
database "Artifact Store\nmemory or Redis (art_*)" as ArtifactStoreDb

package "Runtime Services" {
  component "ServerRegistry" as Registry
  component "OgcHttpClient\n(bounded, budgeted)" as Transport
  component "CapabilityCache" as Capabilities
  component "FallbackEngine" as Fallbacks
  component "ProxyPlanner" as Planner
  component "PlanningWorkflow\n(LangGraph-ready)" as Workflow
  component "ResponseSanitizer" as Sanitizer
  component "OutputArtifactPipeline" as ArtifactPipeline
}

package "OGC Module Services" {
  component "CommonService" as Common
  component "FeaturesService" as Features
  component "RecordsService" as Records
  component "ProcessesService" as Processes
}

cloud "Registered OGC API Servers\n(operator-approved only)" as OGC {
  component "Common API" as CommonApi
  component "Features API" as FeaturesApi
  component "Records API" as RecordsApi
  component "Processes/Jobs API" as ProcessesApi
}

User --> React : natural-language request
React --> Gateway : POST /api/chat (SSE stream)
Gateway --> Gemini : conversation + MCP tool schemas
Gemini --> Gateway : tool call or final answer
Gateway --> Client : MCP tool call (ogc_proxy_confirm_plan\nand ogc_proxy_artifact_retrieve withheld from Gemini)
Gateway --> React : tool_start/tool_result, approval_request,\noutput_manifest, map_data, answer, done

Client --> App : MCP tool calls
App --> Runtime
Runtime --> Registry
Runtime --> Transport
Runtime --> Common
Runtime --> Features
Runtime --> Records
Runtime --> Processes
Runtime --> Capabilities
Runtime --> Fallbacks
Runtime --> Planner
Runtime --> Workflow
Runtime --> Sanitizer
Runtime --> ArtifactPipeline

Planner --> PlanStore
App --> MemoryStore : response_mode="summary"
ArtifactPipeline --> ArtifactStoreDb : art_* handles
Processes --> ArtifactPipeline : execute / jobs.get_results

Common --> Transport
Features --> Transport
Records --> Transport
Processes --> Transport
Capabilities --> Transport
ArtifactPipeline --> Transport : bounded reference resolution

Transport --> CommonApi
Transport --> FeaturesApi
Transport --> RecordsApi
Transport --> ProcessesApi

note right of Gateway
  Node privately hydrates art_* / mem_*
  handles for rendering; Gemini only ever
  sees coordinate-stripped, sanitized
  summaries and manifest states.
end note

@enduml
